SUMMARY:Sweet Traditions: Exploring Latine Desserts\, Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Discover the rich flavors and cultural stories behind some be
 loved Latine desserts in a series of cooking demonstrations that bring ti
 me-honored recipes to life. Each session highlights a different cultural 
 treat.Whether you're looking to expand your culinary repertoire or reconn
 ect with cherished flavors\, Sweet Traditions invites you to savor the sw
 eetness of Latine heritages\, one dessert at a time.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p class="x_MsoNormal"><span data-ogsc="rgb(
 33\, 33\, 33)" data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Discover the rich flavo
 rs and cultural stories behind some beloved Latine desserts in a series o
 f cooking demonstrations that bring time-honored recipes to life. Each se
 ssion highlights a different cultural treat.</span></p><p class="x_MsoNor
 mal"><span data-ogsc="rgb(33\, 33\, 33)"></span></p><p class="x_MsoNormal
 "><span data-ogsc="rgb(33\, 33\, 33)">Whether you're looking to expand yo
 ur culinary repertoire or reconnect with cherished flavors\, Sweet Tradit
