GEO:39.168732;-86.525021
SUMMARY:Drop-In Career Coaching: Navigate Your Job or Internship Search
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with the Office of Career Exploration &amp\; S
 tudent Employment (CESE)\, Career Coach Angela Martin will be available a
 t La Casa to provide on-site career coaching and professional guidance fo
 r students.  This is a great opportunity to receive personalized feedback
  on your resume or LinkedIn profile\, discuss career goals\, explore job 
 and internship opportunities\, or ask questions about your professional d
 evelopment. Whether you're just getting started or preparing for your nex
 t step\, it's never too early or too late to seek career support.  Drop i
 n\, ask questions\, and gain insights to help you move forward with confi
 dence in your career journey.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">  In p
 artnership with the Office of Career Exploration &amp\; Student Employmen
 t (CESE)\, Career Coach Angela Martin will be available at La Casa to pro
 vide on-site career coaching and professional guidance for students.</p><
 p>  This is a great opportunity to receive personalized feedback on your 
 resume or LinkedIn profile\, discuss career goals\, explore job and inter
 nship opportunities\, or ask questions about your professional developmen
 t. Whether you're just getting started or preparing for your next step\, 
 it's never too early or too late to seek career support.</p><p>  Drop in\
 , ask questions\, and gain insights to help you move forward with confide
 nce in your career journey.</p>
