SUMMARY:Dia de los Muertos
DESCRIPTION:Learn more about the background and traditions of this specia
 l celebration hosted by La Casa (715 E. 7th St)\, LGBTQ+ Culture Center (
 705 E.7th St.)\, FNECC (712 E. 8th St.) and the Canterbury House (719 E. 
 7th St.). Be sure to visit all participating centers during this special 
 event to view the altars honoring loved ones\, participate in activities\
 , and enjoy the delicious refreshments offered at each location.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Learn more about the background and tra
 ditions of this special celebration hosted by La Casa (715 E. 7th St)\, L
 GBTQ+ Culture Center (705 E.7<sup>th</sup> St.)\, FNECC (712 E. 8<sup>th<
 /sup> St.) and the Canterbury House (719 E. 7<sup>th</sup> St.). Be sure 
 to visit all participating centers during this special event to view the 
 altars honoring loved ones\, participate in activities\, and enjoy the de
 licious refreshments offered at each location.</p>
