SUMMARY:La Casa Turns 53!
DESCRIPTION:La Casa opened its doors on November 14\, 1973\, to celebrate
  community\, culture\, and connections! Join us for cake\, ice cream\, an
 d fun goodies as we honor this special milestone. Stop by\, even if just 
 for a little while\, we love to see you on this very special day.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">
 La Casa opened its doors on November 14\, 1973\, to celebrate community\,
  culture\, and connections! Join us for cake\, ice cream\, and fun goodie
 s as we honor this special milestone. Stop by\, even if just for a little
  while\, we love to see you on this very special day.</span></p>
